1
00:00:00,555 --> 00:00:03,725
(Penny:)I will pay you back as soon as I can.
You just have to give me time.

2
00:00:03,891 --> 00:00:06,481
- Oh, wait. You lent her money?
- She needed money.

3
00:00:06,644 --> 00:00:09,934
(Penny:)You seem under pressure.
Did I not lend you a sufficient amount?

4
00:00:10,106 --> 00:00:11,236
(Penny:)I can give you more.

5
00:00:11,399 --> 00:00:15,609
(Penny:)Oh, you know, you would just love that,
wouldn't you?

6
00:00:15,778 --> 00:00:16,908
(Penny:)Yeah.

7
00:00:17,321 --> 00:00:20,161
(Penny:)You would just love to open up
your little snake can...

8
00:00:20,324 --> 00:00:23,204
(Penny:)...and throw some money at the girl
who can't pay her bills.

9
00:00:23,661 --> 00:00:24,661
[SIGHS]

10
00:00:24,829 --> 00:00:26,369
- Where are you going?
- Going home.

11
00:00:26,539 --> 00:00:29,379
(Penny:)Where I won't be interrogated
like a criminal.

12
00:00:34,338 --> 00:00:36,928
(Penny:)I forgot my fortune cookie.

13
00:00:40,761 --> 00:00:43,101
(Sheldon:)In case either of you
have larceny in your heart...

14
00:00:43,264 --> 00:00:46,354
(Sheldon:)...you should know that I've moved
my money out of the snake can.

15
00:00:49,687 --> 00:01:01,027
(Leonard:)But if you're ever short, there's always
a couple of 50s in Green Lantern's ass.

